flowchart TD
    Q[Question + evidence] --> IV[Input validation]
    IV --> GP[Grounded prompt\nEvidence marked untrusted data]
    GP --> G[Gemini]
    G --> RAW[Raw structured response]
    RAW --> SV[Schema / JSON validation]
    SV --> RV[Risk category and level validation]
    RV --> EV[Evidence ID and safety validation]
    EV --> OUT[Validated risk analysis\nsummary + citations + risks + disclaimer]
    OUT --> ORCH[Orchestrator]
